title: SalemDay1Start
---
<<declare $playerName="Holder">>
<<gatherVars>>

Entering Poem and Prose, the wind chime sang as you stepped in.

You expected Salem, but another worker wiped the counters.

You sighed in disappointment.

Your stomach rumbled. Might as well eat.

You approached the counter. The server looked up and smiled.

Server: "Hello, welcome to Poem and Prose. What would you like?"

Her voice was overly polite. You smiled back.

You: "Hi, I'd like a toastie... and also a coffee."

You specified your drink. She wrote it down and gestured to sit.

The café was warm and cozy, just like yesterday.

Looking around, it was mostly empty except for—

Salem sat in the corner, eating from a container.

She hummed softly, peaceful as she ate.

You: "Salem!"

<<setBool SalemDiaImageState true>>
Salem: "Oh hey there {$playerName}!"

She smiled brightly, wiping her mouth with a napkin.

You sat across from her.

You noticed her curry. It smelled incredible.

-> It looked so delicious
    <<incRelationship "Salem" 1>>
    <<jump Delicious>>
-> The curry seemed alright
    <<jump Alright>>
-> The curry seemed weird looking to you
    <<decRelationship "Salem" 1>>
    <<jump Weird>>
===

title: Delicious
---
You tried not to drool.

You: "Wow... that looks so good."

You slumped in your seat.

Salem: "Thank you, I made it."

She scooped some onto her spoon.

Then held it out to you.

Salem: "Come on, open your mouth."

You hesitated, then complied.

The flavor burst across your tongue.

You: "Thank you..."

Salem: "..."

She only smiled.

<<jump SalemHeadBops>>
===

title: Alright
---
You: "Ooo, that looks nice."

Salem: "I made it myself, so thank you."

She happily continued eating.

You wondered what else she could cook.

<<jump SalemHeadBops>>
===

title: Weird
---
You looked at the curry with discomfort.

You: "Uh... that's nice..."

You leaned back, uneasy.

Salem: "..."

She went silent.

<<jump SalemHeadBops>>
===

title: SalemHeadBops
---
Salem’s head suddenly lifted, her smile fading.

You turned to see your server holding your food.

Her face showed irritation.

Then she forced a smile.

Server: "Uh... how about you eat over here?"

Server: "There's no room to set your food down."

You turned back.

Salem stared at her food, eating quietly.

There was clearly enough space.

You raised an eyebrow.

-> Take the food yourself
    <<incRelationship "Salem" 1>>
    <<jump TakeFood>>
-> Have the server serve you
    <<jump MakeServer>>
-> Move away from Salem
    <<decRelationship "Salem" 1>>
    <<jump MoveAway>>
===

title: TakeFood
---
You stood and took your food yourself.

The server spluttered.

You placed it at your table.

Salem squeaked in surprise.

She looked relieved when you sat back down.

She resumed eating.

<<jump DoneFood>>
===

title: MakeServer
---
You: "What's wrong? There's plenty of room."

The server looked annoyed but complied.

You noticed her gag at Salem’s food.

Understanding dawned.

Salem never looked up.

<<jump DoneFood>>
===

title: MoveAway
---
You glanced at Salem.

She kept her head down.

You: "I'll talk to you after I eat, Salem."

She nodded. You moved tables. 
The server suddenly acted cheerful.

You ignored it.

<<jump DoneFood>>
===

title: DoneFood
---
You: "So... you feeling okay?"

Salem: "Yeah, don't worry about me, okay?"

She wiped her mouth.

Salem: "Why do you ask?"

You thought about earlier.

You: "Nothing."

She stared at you strangely.

Salem: "I have your answer here."

She handed you a folded paper.

You perked up.

You: "Oh thanks!"

She smiled.

<<pushObjectiveIndex "Doing the Rounds">>
===

title: EndSalem1
---
You: "This is great, thank you."

You placed it in your folder.

Salem beamed.

You handed her another paper.

You: "It’s the next question."

Salem: "I’ll answer this for tomorrow."
<<setBool SalemDiaImageState false>>

She read it immediately.

You stood to leave.

She waved goodbye.

===
